WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.064 --> 00:00:09.480
Try it first in Practice if you like: write the way a customer would.

2
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:18.584
Your assistant drafts a reply. Read it, change what you like, and send it.

3
00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:26.098
The step is done when you send a reply to a real customer, in the Inbox.
